
The survey is here
	https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1DjE76zj4Df1WI-x-PLSVYfbhXeqoGkPVRHW6xJPPurg/edit	

It was generated by this google script
	https://script.google.com/home/projects/1haspNtnmp19mnBt_H2WFLqbogkc8B-XnOXwEOtEjsjaOlXGB8tj66qxR/edit?pli=1

The results are collected here
	https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1yhzJ2BzL1BjDMeIem1ekt5D39FCxr1a-MMLP74Jajlw/edit?resourcekey=&gid=213074100#gid=213074100

We tweaked the survey so you have to look at Form 3 and Form 1 responses.
They were manually combined into the "Combined" tab, which was downloaded
as a CSV file and appears in this repo as compdeps.csv

The alsof.py file is a python3 script that generates various reports,
including a memgraph input file for visualizations.
